01:24:12.138 --> 01:24:15.138
We are living in shallow water.

203
01:24:20.138 --> 01:24:24.138
His prayer life may provoke us.

204
01:24:25.138 --> 01:24:27.138
He is the Son of Man.

205
01:24:31.138 --> 01:24:34.138
You are a born-again son or daughter of God.

206
01:24:36.138 --> 01:24:38.138
You cannot do it without Him.

207
01:24:41.138 --> 01:24:44.138
We need a revelation of prayer in this hour.

208
01:24:50.138 --> 01:24:54.138
We need that unity with the Father.

209
01:24:55.138 --> 01:25:07.138
And during that week, Jesus needs a place to rest, and that place is Bethany.

210
01:25:11.138 --> 01:25:14.138
Let us read that in John chapter 12 starting from verse 1.

211
01:25:21.138 --> 01:25:24.138
So this is the day before He entered the city.

212
01:25:26.138 --> 01:25:32.138
Six days before Passover, Jesus went to Bethany.

213
01:25:36.138 --> 01:25:39.138
Where Lazarus lived, whom He had raised from the dead.

214
01:25:45.138 --> 01:25:50.138
